    constr-exterior-wall,         !- Name  Kept: name of the construction
    Stucco 7/16 in,               !- Outside Layer  Source: info.txt, layer 1
    Rigid Foam R-6,               !- Layer 2  Source: info.txt, layer 4
    OSB 7/16 in,                  !- Layer 3  Source: info.txt, layer 5
