    Gypsum 1/2 in;                !- Layer 5  Source: info.txt, layer 7
! Source for Construction "constr-interior-wall": info.txt, interior wall: 2x4 wood studs, 4 in thick, 1/2 in gypsum board on both sides. The stud cavity is an air space (ASSUMED: no insulation in the walls between rooms).
